notes = "(!) BIOS files are found by CRC32 in the system/supracan folder (also superacan and SuperAcan) or in system, loose or in a .zip or .7z, under any name.|(!) internal_68k.bin (crc): 8d575662|(!) internal_6502_1.bin (crc): fc9fb05f|(!) internal_6502_2.bin (crc): bf950ab7|(!) umc6650.bin (crc): 0ba78597|(^) Super Dragon Force comes in two files; the core joins them when they are in the same .zip or .7z."

description = "V-Bear emulates the Funtech Super A'Can (Taiwan, 1995): Motorola 68000, 65C02 sound CPU, UM6618 video and UM6619 sound chips. It runs the 12 released games. A BIOS is required. Games can be loose, in a .zip or in a .7z."
